msgid "Tracing with OpenTelemetry"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Infinispan supports instrumentation of the server via OpenTelemetry. Having "
"the `quarkus-opentelemetry` extension will propagate\n"
"the traces from the Infinispan Client to the Server.\n"
