msgid "Bounded near caching"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You should always use bounded near caches by specifying the maximum number "
"of entries they can contain."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bloom filters"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you need to optimize the performance for write operations by reducing the "
"total number of invalidation messages,\n"
"enable bloom filter. Bloom filters reside on Infinispan Server and keep "
"track of the entries that the client has requested.\n"
"They cannot be used with unbounded near cache: maximum number of entries "
"must be defined when enabling bloom filters."
msgstr ""

