msgid "Shared server"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus will share the Infinispan broker if you have multiple applications "
"running in dev mode.\n"
"Dev Services for Infinispan implements a _service discovery_ mechanism for "
"your multiple Quarkus applications running in _dev_ mode to share a single "
"broker."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you need multiple (shared) Infinispan server, you can configure the "
"`quarkus.infinispan-client.devservices.service-name` attribute and indicate "
"the server name.\n"
"It looks for a container with the same value, or starts a new one if none "
"can be found.\n"
